[[Category:Sharp Tools]]

{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Tools|$Axes|W$oodsman's Axe}}

==Primary Function==

The '''Woodsman's Axe''' is the fastest axe for chopping [[tree]]s. It consumes only a single stamina bar per tree and gives the same yield from chopping blocks per log as [[Metal Axe]].

==As Sharp Tool==

{{PAGENAME}} can be used for actions like shearing a [[sheep]], skinning and butchering a [[Creatures|creature]]. Applies its quality as [[softcap]] to the [[wool]], [[intestines]], [[entrails]], and raw meats.

==As Weapon==

Counts as "Any edged weapon" which allows use of certain [[Combat moves]] like Chop and Sideswipe. 20% Armor Penetration

==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}Tin+ _{q}Hard Metal+ _{q}Oak Block}{3} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>.
* Damage scales with strength and weapon quality using the following formula: <math>Damage = 55*\sqrt{\sqrt{Strength*{q}Axe}/10}</math>.

